{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:30 2026-11-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:30 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:30 2026-11-28 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ad17112975bddda57060596083ccfd4/2026-11/2026-11-28_00_27_10.png\"/><p>落馬洲坑頭村發生懷疑管有仿製槍械案。今日（28日）凌晨3時53分，警方接獲報案，指一名男子形跡可疑，懷疑攜帶類似長槍的物品。</p><p>警員接報到場，在坑頭村發現一名61歲姓梁男子，並檢獲兩把懷疑仿製槍械。經初步調查，警方以涉嫌「管有仿製槍械」拘捕該名男子，他現正被扣留調查。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T00:43:52.167403+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T00:30:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:17:27.146811+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T00:37:25.311232+00:00","content_hash":"1c4bfbdc3764d5e1a815646e9021584b41fd03b2577bb70d80598952b83736d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}